      "widgets_values": [
        "# Fibo 2.0 Dev: text to image\n\nFibo 2.0 Dev, text to image: **30 steps, CFG 5**, euler / simple.\n\n## Models\n\n[Comfy-Org/Fibo-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Fibo-2.0), installed by the profile\ndeclared in the **Workflow profiles** node (int8 variant). For bf16, change the variant there\nand use **Check the workflow's models…**.\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/models/\n├── 📂 diffusion_models/fibo2/\n├── 📂 text_encoders/fibo2/   (CLIPLoader type: fibo2)\n├── 📂 loras/fibo2/\n└── 📂 vae/fibo2/\n```\n\n## Prompt\n\n`TextEncodeFibo2` takes plain text or a Bria structured JSON caption. Leave the negative prompt\nempty: it is the null caption Fibo 2.0 was trained with. Width/height 0 = the trained size\n(about 1 MP, 1024×1024 without image).\n\nNeeds ComfyUI with Fibo 2.0 support (merged on master on 2026-10-20, after v0.42.4).\n\nLicense of the weights: CC BY-NC 4.0 (BRIA AI), non-commercial use only.\n"
      ],
      "title": "Fibo 2.0"
    },
